      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:0",
          "text": "Put Explosive Charge on an enemy champion, then keep attacking them. Each attack or ability adds to the bomb, and a full bomb explodes at once.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Tristana-E", "start": 4, "end": 20 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.04
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:1",
          "text": "Turn on Rapid Fire when you start trading. The extra Attack Speed stacks your bomb faster.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Tristana-Q", "start": 8, "end": 18 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.04
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:2",
          "text": "Jump away with Rocket Jump when an enemy runs at you. It slows them when you land.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Tristana-W", "start": 15, "end": 26 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "slowed", "start": 57, "end": 62 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.09
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:3",
          "text": "Look for a kill with a full bomb. A takedown or full-stack explosion on a champion resets Rocket Jump, so you can jump in again or escape.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Tristana-W", "start": 90, "end": 101 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.02
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:4",
          "text": "Hit the enemy with Buster Shot when they get close. It knocks them away and stuns them, which protects you.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Tristana-R", "start": 19, "end": 30 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.7
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:5",
          "text": "Use your long range from Draw a Bead to attack from a distance. It grows as you level, so you can stay out of reach.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Tristana-passive",
              "start": 25,
              "end": 36
            }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.18
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Tristana:general:6",
          "text": "Last-hit minions with your attacks to make them explode. Explosive Charge then damages nearby enemies, which helps when you push the wave.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Tristana-E", "start": 57, "end": 73 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.36
        }
      ],
      "combos": []
    }
  ],
